### ListDocuments — CLIENT (свои)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}

### ListDocuments — с фильтром по типу
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents?docType=SELFIE
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}

### ListDocuments — OFFICER (по customer_id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents?customerId={{user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{officerAccessToken}}

### GetDownloadUrl — CLIENT (свой)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}

### GetDownloadUrl — OFFICER
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{officerAccessToken}}

### GetDownloadUrl — несуществующий (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/download
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}

### GetDownloadUrl — не CONFIRMED (412)
### (создайте InitUpload без Confirm)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents/01a1da10-056e-7b01-a225-e29651639391/download
Authorization: Bearer {{clientAccessToken}}

### GetDownloadUrl — чужой документ (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/documents/{{documentId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{client2AccessToken}}